subtitle: Currently we have a [+ bnl_tourism_name +] tourism policy. \[-1 budget\]
choose-if: government_budget >= 1 and bnl_tourism_level < 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if government_budget < 1: Not enough budget. ?][? if government_budget > 1: Our tourism policy has been eased to its maximum. ?]
